                        "entry_id": "04c932cc-3d91-3fc9-84ff-61dadd2649c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui doute, qui se pose des questions, sans forcément croire à une théorie du complot. Mot créé pour nuancer les termes complotiste et conspirationniste."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6b7b1c4-f244-4fe3-886a-68718a22e8ec",
                                "sense_id": "1a677930-47ac-341b-8cf4-2407050ee1e4",
                                "text": "On peut se questionner. Moi, je ne suis pas complotiste, je suis questionniste."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0124f77d-9b2c-4833-bdbc-5d242ec1a3e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "04c932cc-3d91-3fc9-84ff-61dadd2649c2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1a677930-47ac-341b-8cf4-2407050ee1e4",
                        "target_lang_word": "skeptic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skeptic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                        "entry_id": "ca9f8a0e-8938-3978-b011-bde8dbf814af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who doubts beliefs, claims, plans, etc that are accepted by others as true or appropriate, especially one who habitually does so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f95c4747-1e5f-4e3e-ae27-3c6b28119573",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "Skeptics of this alliance were proven right because this partnership lasted only for a few years. Once Albania broke off diplomatic relations […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4137fe2f-365a-46c5-ade5-dec047ead25d",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "But for the fly he might have made me think He had been at his poetry , comparing Nailhead with fly and fly with huckleberry : How like a fly , how very like a fly . But the real fly he missed would never do ; The missed fly made me dangerously skeptic.[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77c9c87a-0349-44b8-973b-b2f490bfa4bf",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "The official account of this meeting was that it ended in failure, with the Taliban's mullah Omar telling General Ahmed, “Osama will be the last person to leave Afghanistan.” The 9/11 skeptics believe that meeting was meant to fail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e313e317-417b-4fa1-b3aa-6694100882f1",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "Even skeptics of the policy acknowledge that the Army conducted an exemplary insourcing program that successfully counteracted the Comptroller's budget ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb6b6109-42b4-43e3-8563-9109a57e5d70",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "The Buddha's perfect body is particularly important in these tropes, and it serves to persuade skeptics of his claims to ultimate authority."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cecbf35-52e6-372e-8e00-ab2074e6f02d",
                                        "entry_id": "ca9f8a0e-8938-3978-b011-bde8dbf814af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who is skeptical towards religion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "skeptic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                        "entry_id": "a10754a8-de95-3ae1-b7b6-8c739a4d8813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skeptical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec4c7879-2f0a-412c-857e-afbb53545ab4",
                                                "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                                "text": "This view of the Great Pyramid is being adopted by a widening circle of Christian believers, until even a skeptic scientist has dignified it as “the religion of the Pyramid!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0a6ac1b-aef6-47cb-bde4-a8735c57248f",
                                                "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                                "text": "No one but you can convince my heart, the stubborn, skeptic heart of mine to break the bad habit of breaking away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0949748d-46af-46a1-b116-6c46b6058638",
                                                "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                                "text": "With an increase in divorce rates and half of them growing up with divorced parents, they have a very skeptic view of the concept of ‘happily ever after’."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
